        "            event_log=self.event_log,\n",
        "            event_position_df=self.layout,\n",
        "            every_x_time_units=time_interval,\n",
        "            scenario=self.params,\n",
        "            custom_resource_icon=\"👩‍⚕️\",  # NEW - note the quotation marks!\n",
        "            resource_icon_size=32,  # NEW\n",
        "        )\n",
        "```\n",
        "\n",
        "## What custom Resource Icons can we use?\n",
        "\n",
        "At the moment, vidigi supports **emojis**.\n",
        "\n",
        "Yep - that kind of emoji.\n",
        "\n",
        "::: {style='font-size: 150%;'}\n",
        "😁 🤣 😉 🤪 🫠 😭 😱\n",
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "But there are also quite a lot of relevant ones.\n",
        "\n",
        "::: {style='font-size: 150%;'}\n",
        "👩‍⚕️ 👨🏿‍⚕️ 🛏️ 🏥 🚑\n",
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "I find the best place to look them up and copy them in is [emojipedia.org](https://emojipedia.org/)\n",
