        "\n",
        "```{.python}\n",
        "my_event_log = my_trial.trial_logger.get_log_by_run(run=2, as_df=True)\n",
        "```\n",
        "\n",
        "<br>\n",
        "\n",
        "::: {.value-box icon=\"fa-solid fa-lightbulb\" icon-position=\"left\" align=\"center\" color=\"bg-green\"}\n",
        "Now we can regenerate the animation for different runs by just changing what we pass to that `run` parameter!\n",
        ":::"
